<!DOCTYPE html><html xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
<!--/* Rev AA 28-06-2023 */-->
<head>
  <title>gms_g: Conversion between angle/hour units</title>
<meta content="text/html; charset=ISO-8859-1" http-equiv="Content-Type"/></head>

<body>
<!--Aquí inicia la part corresponent al títol de la MSA. Aquesta part s'ha d'editar desde el document WPS (aplicacio.mps).-->
<h1><span id="wpstitol"/></h1>
<!--Aquí acaba la part corresponent títol de la MSA editable de el WPS.-->

<p>This application allows to convert angular measurements:</p><ul>  <li>from sexagesimal degrees (degrees, minutes, and seconds, e.g. 15° 30' 36.72") to decimal degrees (degrees and decimal fractions of a degree, e.g., 5.51020000°) and vice versa</li><li>from sexagesimal or decimal degrees to radians (e.g.: 0.2707040576 rad) and vice versa</li></ul><p>as well as between hourly magnitudes:</p><ul><li>hours and decimal fractions of an hour to hours, minutes, and seconds, and vice versa (useful for converting, for example, satellite passing hours).</li></ul></p>

<p>The options of the program are:</p>
  <!--Aquí inicia la part corresponent a les opcions de de la MSA. Aquesta part s'ha d'editar desde el document WPS (aplicacio.mps).-->
<span id="wpsopcions"/>
<!--Aquí acaba la part corresponent a les opcions de de la MSA editable de el WPS.-->

  <p>In conversions between angular magnitudes, when the origin of the conversion is in degrees, the format can be in decimal degrees or sexagesimal degrees. On the other hand, if the result is indicated in degrees, the desired format must be specified. In case the angular quantities are negative, the sign will be associated with the largest non-zero magnitude. Examples: -5º 25' 43.6&quot;, 0º -3' 45.5&quot;, 0º 0' -5.3&quot;</p>
  
  <p> For command line executions, it may be especially useful to use the /BAN parameter in order to get the converted amount directly, without any other text.</p>
  <hr/>

  <exclusiva>
<!-- Aquí inicia la part corresponent a la sintaxi de miramon. Aquesta part s'ha d'editar desde el document WPS (aplicacio.mps).-->
